BBTech: The Playbook Series
===========================
Reproducible System Protocols for Basketball-to-Biotech Research

Overview
--------
The Playbook Series is BBTech's library of canonical system designs.
Each volume is a lab manual + film-room breakdown that defines:
  - Biological model (disease, therapy, ecosystem)
  - Required archetypes (which "player-types" are needed)
  - Metric formulas and simulation recipes
  - Experiment templates

The Playbooks are modular, reproducible protocols that can be implemented by anyone
using game logs, biological datasets, or synthetic benchmarks.
They are the core intellectual output of the BBTech Digital Research Lab.

---

