Codex and Ledger Integration
=============================
All Playbook simulations are:
  - Logged to the BBTech ledger with tx_hash, parameters, and outcomes
  - Scored using Codex metrics (TER, Trueness, Flow, Gravity, etc.)
  - Reproducible via payload replay from ledger records

This ensures:
  - Full provenance and auditability
  - Cross-lab reproducibility
  - Compliance with research integrity standards

