Publishing Model
================
The Playbook Series is designed as:
  - Open-source protocol library (core systems publicly available)
  - Semi-open IP for advanced/clinical systems (available to research partners)
  - Educational product (book series, workshop materials, developer docs)

Commercial Use:
  - Free for academic and non-commercial research
  - Licensing available for biotech/pharma integration
  - Revenue supports ongoing BBTech Lab operations and new volume development

